{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans are weak! You can\u2019t go anywhere without your STRANGER MAIDENS!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/fe7916904a1c97860a83380f2858e2c6.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game System\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not like your typical Roguelike Survivor, this game focuses on an innovative Squad Based Combat System. Adept to various challenges with a diverse cast of Stranger Maidens, build your ultimate team to eliminate your foes.<br><br>   Explore 19 handcrafted stages, conquer perilous hazards and stage gimmicks, defeat challenging bosses all the while racing against the clock. Utilize the unique &quot;TEAM ROTATION&quot; mechanic to unleash the full potential of the ladies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want optimize your way to victory, or you just want to hangout with your favorite girls, \u201cStranger Maidens\u201d will provide you with a satisfying experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/fa14569ae9724fac1eddbd43a397406f.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/fa14569ae9724fac1eddbd43a397406f.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/fa14569ae9724fac1eddbd43a397406f.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Joey, a loser who was traumatised by the loss of his father. One day you received a mysterious artefact left by your father, and you are determined to go on an adventure to find out what happened to him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your journey you will encounter a variety of beautiful yet mysterious Strangers Maidens, each with their own story to tell. Combining their combat prowess and the strange power of the artefact, you come closer to the truth with every step\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Feature\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Tactical Squad Based Combat System provides many possibilities in every battle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades await your discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional RPG narration style, you get stories both in and out of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 uniquely designed story stages, 7 fearsome story bosses with unique design and challenge, no more repetitive gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Stranger Maidens each with their own story and unique charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 fully hand drawn sex scenes, 12 live2D animated with dynamic cameras. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/e942100478a70565c639d4d2c6a32f69.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/e942100478a70565c639d4d2c6a32f69.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/e942100478a70565c639d4d2c6a32f69.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/9d4388097b35111ecd3309510894c94c.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/9d4388097b35111ecd3309510894c94c.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/9d4388097b35111ecd3309510894c94c.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Stranger Maidens\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/03ee57c239d2cda15988198c2651fb3a.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/03ee57c239d2cda15988198c2651fb3a.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/03ee57c239d2cda15988198c2651fb3a.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shu\u2019Rah</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barbarian warrior of the Northern Highland. With combat ferocity as explosive as her temperament, she is a reliable companion who is to be admired and feared. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Combat, Shu\u2019Rah uses her exceptional physique to stand between the enemies and her team, keeping all dangers away from her teammates. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/17f62ed67718954dc8f4c68f7114e5cc.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/17f62ed67718954dc8f4c68f7114e5cc.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/17f62ed67718954dc8f4c68f7114e5cc.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alith</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elite huntress from the Underground. She might appear to be sweet and naive, but she is hiding some secrets\u2026  <br>Her mastercraft crossbow allows her to sniper enemies from afar, and her wolf and traps can effectively weaken her prey. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/343fa2b5e42c605e422ac62fd6fa6b5a.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/343fa2b5e42c605e422ac62fd6fa6b5a.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/343fa2b5e42c605e422ac62fd6fa6b5a.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jezerin</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seductive Demon mage. Despite her diabolical appearance, she has a very gentle soul, and the only thing she has to match her look is her exceptional horniness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the battlefield she weaves destructive fire magics, burning all enemies to crisp in a blink of an eye.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/abe868ddb3e59805fde582db12190a53.