height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/17f62ed67718954dc8f4c68f7114e5cc.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/17f62ed67718954dc8f4c68f7114e5cc.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alith</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elite huntress from the Underground. She might appear to be sweet and naive, but she is hiding some secrets\u2026  <br>Her mastercraft crossbow allows her to sniper enemies from afar, and her wolf and traps can effectively weaken her prey. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/343fa2b5e42c605e422ac62fd6fa6b5a.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/343fa2b5e42c605e422ac62fd6fa6b5a.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/343fa2b5e42c605e422ac62fd6fa6b5a.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jezerin</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seductive Demon mage. Despite her diabolical appearance, she has a very gentle soul, and the only thing she has to match her look is her exceptional horniness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the battlefield she weaves destructive fire magics, burning all enemies to crisp in a blink of an eye.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/abe868ddb3e59805fde582db12190a53.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/abe868ddb3e59805fde582db12190a53.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/abe868ddb3e59805fde582db12190a53.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also known as Black Orchid the Flying Thief, Bo is a femme fatale haunted by bad blood, and she has absolutely no time for bullshits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her proficiency with throwing weapons allows her to perform a wide variety of attacks, not to mention she is very familiar with using poison.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/b36fae229f13e639d48bb6a87b285d54.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/b36fae229f13e639d48bb6a87b285d54.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/b36fae229f13e639d48bb6a87b285d54.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shanni</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Goblin Shaman who lives alone in the swamp. Despite having the wisdom of a thousand ancestors by her side, she is an absolute nightmare to hangout with due to her toxicity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her sorcery allows her to put curses on a large area, sucking the life out of everything that dares to linger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/5876a27dd7ad5cd04d8e17849b229516.poster.avif?t=1772372642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/5876a27dd7ad5cd04d8e17849b229516.webm?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/extras/5876a27dd7ad5cd04d8e17849b229516.mp4?t=1772372642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kiritsuki</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An honorable Lizard swordsman from a far away Empire, she is on a suicide mission to hunt down a murderous fiend who slaughtered all her kins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not be fooled by her elegance, her swordsmanship is a truly deadly art, able to dish out terrible damage in a flash.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Volcanic Good Boy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028830/7cbc1a84f6ada1a1e9ce9dc2fe9714145bd9184e/header.jpg?t=1772372642","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3028830/829901/6ac78812094da350656f6d0f675a1029a79ec5cc/1750959236/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740236175","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3028830/829901/6ac78812094da350656f6d0f675a1029a79ec5cc/1750959236/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740236175","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3028830/829901/6ac78812094da350656f6d0f675a1029a79ec5cc/1750959236/hls_264_master.m